...@../../_tools/theme
direction: down

user: 사용자 (브라우저) { class: person }
ui: Streamlit UI (app.py) { class: ours }

runner: "InMemoryRunner (plugins=[SimplePlugin()])" {
  class: ours
  direction: down

  plugin: "SimplePlugin\n(전역 훅 - 모든 실행에 적용)" { class: ours }

  agent_scope: plugin_demo_agent (LlmAgent) {
    class: ours
    direction: down

    gemini: Gemini API (gemini-3-flash-preview) { class: ext }
    tool_fn: 계산기 도구 (calculator_tool) { class: ours }
  }
}

user -> ui: 메시지
ui -> runner: run_agent(message)
runner.plugin -> runner.agent_scope: 훅마다 먼저 가로챈 뒤 통과
runner.agent_scope -> runner.agent_scope.gemini: 모델 요청
runner.agent_scope.gemini -> runner.agent_scope.tool_fn: 함수 호출이면 위임
runner.agent_scope.tool_fn -> runner.agent_scope.gemini: 결과 재전달
runner.agent_scope.gemini -> ui: 최종 텍스트
ui -> user: 화면에 표시
